Subject: [client,sdl2] handle AUTH_RDSTLS in the credential dialog

The SDL2 client never showed a prompt for AUTH_RDSTLS (used by the AVD ARM
gateway redirect to collect the Windows password), so arm_fill_rdstls failed
silently with "error retrieving ARM configuration". Ports the SDL3 client cases.

diff --git a/client/SDL/SDL2/dialogs/sdl_dialogs.cpp b/client/SDL/SDL2/dialogs/sdl_dialogs.cpp
index 3d19736..b593716 100644
--- a/client/SDL/SDL2/dialogs/sdl_dialogs.cpp
+++ b/client/SDL/SDL2/dialogs/sdl_dialogs.cpp
@@ -94,6 +94,7 @@ BOOL sdl_authenticate_ex(freerdp* instance, char** username, char** password, ch
 	const char* target = freerdp_settings_get_server_name(instance->context->settings);
 	switch (reason)
 	{
+		case AUTH_RDSTLS:
 		case AUTH_NLA:
 			break;
 
@@ -567,6 +568,7 @@ BOOL sdl_auth_dialog_show(const SDL_UserAuthArg* args)
 		case AUTH_FIDO_PIN:
 			prompt = fidoPin;
 			break;
+		case AUTH_RDSTLS:
 		case AUTH_TLS:
 		case AUTH_RDP:
 		case AUTH_NLA:
